{"unit_id":"qigelunbiya__DSH-Patrol#feature-browser","repo":"qigelunbiya/DSH-Patrol","commit":"808d1f9cf70e319ab473df606a007fc7b402ca67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Patrol 的网页巡检功能：把浏览器步骤记录进巡检流程，再由 Runner 按保存的步骤执行。通过巡检工具创建和运行流程，可读取页面、执行浏览器操作并保存结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:207-278","src/runner.ts:114"]}
